sequenceDiagram
  actor Reporter as Borrower or Storekeeper
  actor Operator as Storekeeper or Administrator
  actor Technician as Assigned Technician
  participant Workspace as MaintenanceWorkspace boundary
  participant Page as MaintenanceCasePage boundary
  participant Control as MaintenanceControl
  participant Equipment
  participant Loan
  participant Case as MaintenanceCase
  participant Audit as AuditRecord
  Reporter->>Workspace: Report equipment fault with description and optional loan
  Workspace->>Control: Report fault as authenticated reporter
  Control->>Equipment: Check existence and non-retired status
  opt Loan supplied
    Control->>Loan: Check equipment association
  end
  alt Valid equipment, link and reporter
    Control->>Equipment: Mark UNDER_MAINTENANCE
    Control->>Case: Create OPEN with reporter and report time
    Control->>Audit: Record REPORT_FAULT
    Control-->>Workspace: Created case ID
  else Missing, retired, wrong link or unauthorized
    Control-->>Workspace: Reject without committed maintenance changes
  end
  Note over Control,Loan: UC03 damaged return joins reporting to the return transaction.<br/>Already RETIRED items use UC03 direct case/audit insertion and keep RETIRED.
  Operator->>Workspace: Select OPEN case and active technician
  Workspace->>Control: Assign technician
  Control->>Case: Validate OPEN and set ASSIGNED
  Control->>Audit: Record ASSIGN
  Control-->>Workspace: Assignment recorded
  Technician->>Page: Start assigned case
  Page->>Control: Start maintenance
  Control->>Case: Validate assignment and set IN_PROGRESS
  Control->>Audit: Record START
  loop Optional diagnosis, repair action and note entries
    Technician->>Page: Enter work detail
    Page->>Control: Record work
    Control->>Case: Require assigned actor and IN_PROGRESS
    Control->>Audit: Append work detail without case state change
  end
  Technician->>Page: Complete with resolution note
  Page->>Control: Resolve or mark unrepairable
  Control->>Case: Require assigned actor and IN_PROGRESS
  alt Repaired
    Control->>Case: Set RESOLVED with note and completion time
    Control->>Equipment: Recompute from retirement, other cases and ACTIVE loans
  else Unrepairable
    Control->>Case: Set UNREPAIRABLE with note and completion time
    Control->>Equipment: Set RETIRED
  end
  Control->>Audit: Record completion
  Control-->>Page: Completed case and retained history
  Note over Control,Case: Each mutation validates role, input and current state.<br/>Rejected transitions or wrong technicians do not commit writes.<br/>Terminal cases accept no further work or transition.
